effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 4727a1c0-1ae4-5aea-9cc6-5cd4716431ba))(text "Spinal concept: 16 positive contacts + 1 shared reference + separate passive bias; amplifier linearity and biological recording remain conditional." (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 5af59ee4-5daa-5c39-be26-534126a1c588))(text "HOSTGND and AFEAGND are separate domains. Both receive valid regulated supplies externally; the digital barrier does not generate power." (at 20.32 295.91 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 751d42b1-5a6e-5201-aa5f-c525711c4080))(text "CS_ASSERT low -> island CS_N high. CONNECT low disconnects HV paths; ACQUIRE = CONNECT & RECORD, so 01 remains clamped." (at 20.32 397.51 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 1e4874d9-df94-561b-b528-392980bb0e11))(text "Driver phase admission needs independently observed ISOLATED_READY; neither commands nor fault flags establish voltage or delivery evidence." (at 20.32 405.13 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 79acbbb9-5f1a-5162-a39c-a4e2569e8ee7)))
